<!-- Uses the existing workspace classes and static runtime contract. -->
<template>
<section v-pre id="auditFindingView" class="view">
  <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CYBERSECURITY GOVERNANCE</p><h2>Audit Finding Tracker</h2><p class="lede">Kelola Audit → Finding → Follow-up → Evidence dalam satu alur penelusuran.</p></div></div>
  <div class="risk-management-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Audit Finding Tracker">
    <button id="aftDashboardTab" class="button button-accent" type="button" role="tab" data-aft-tab="dashboard" aria-controls="aftDashboardPanel" aria-selected="true">1. Dashboard</button>
    <button id="aftManageTab" class="button button-quiet" type="button" role="tab" data-aft-tab="manage" aria-controls="aftManagePanel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">2. Kelola Audit</button>
    <button id="aftSmtpTab" class="button button-quiet" type="button" role="tab" data-aft-tab="smtp" aria-controls="aftSmtpPanel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">3. Setting SMTP</button>
  </div>
  <p id="aftStatus" class="save-state" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div id="aftDashboardPanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aftDashboardTab">
<article class="insight-panel gd-controls"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">AUDIT INTELLIGENCE</p><h3>Akuntabilitas &amp; tindak lanjut temuan</h3></div><div class="csf-actions"><button id="aftDashboardRefresh" type="button" class="button button-quiet">Refresh data</button><button id="afAlertsButton" type="button" class="button button-quiet" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="afAlerts">Perlu perhatian <span id="afAlertCount">0</span></button><select id="afExport" aria-label="Ekspor hasil filter"><option value="">Export laporan</option><option value="csv">CSV / Excel</option><option value="json">JSON</option></select></div></div><div class="rd-filters"><label>Audit<select id="afAudit"><option value="">Semua audit</option></select></label><label>PIC finding<select id="afOwner"><option value="">Semua PIC</option></select></label><label>Severity finding<select id="afSeverity"><option value="">Semua severity</option><option>Low</option><option>Medium</option><option>High</option><option>Critical</option></select></label><label>Status finding<select id="afStatus"><option value="">Semua status</option><option>Open</option><option>In progress</option><option>Closed</option></select></label><label>Tenggat finding<select id="afReview"><option value="">Semua tenggat</option><option value="soon">Dalam 30 hari</option><option value="overdue">Overdue</option><option value="missing">Tanpa tanggal</option></select></label><button id="afReset" type="button" class="button button-quiet">Reset filter</button></div><p id="afFilterStatus" class="muted gd-filter-status" role="status"></p></article><div id="afAlerts" class="insight-panel" hidden></div><p class="muted">Filter PIC, severity, status, dan tenggat berlaku pada finding. Audit induk serta follow-up/evidence terkait tetap disertakan.</p><div id="afKpis" class="rd-kpis"></div><div class="gd-visuals"><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">REVIEW &amp; DEADLINES</p><h3>Kalender tenggat finding</h3></div><label>Bulan<input id="afMonth" type="month" aria-label="Bulan kalender"></label></div><p class="muted">Finding belum Closed; merah: lewat tenggat, kuning: dalam 30 hari. Klik tanggal untuk membuka daftar.</p><div class="ra-weekdays" aria-hidden="true"><span>Min</span><span>Sen</span><span>Sel</span><span>Rab</span><span>Kam</span><span>Jum</span><span>Sab</span></div><div id="afCalendar" class="ra-calendar"></div></article><article class="insight-panel"><p class="eyebrow">FINDING SEVERITY</p><h3>Distribusi severity</h3><div id="afSeverities" class="rd-bars"></div></article></div><div class="gd-visuals"><article class="insight-panel"><p class="eyebrow">FINDING STATUS</p><h3>Status penyelesaian</h3><div id="afFindingSummary" class="rd-bars"></div></article><article class="insight-panel"><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNTABILITY</p><h3>Finding per PIC</h3><div id="afOwners" class="rd-bars"></div></article></div><div class="gd-visuals"><article class="insight-panel"><p class="eyebrow">DUE DATE DISTRIBUTION</p><h3>Tenggat finding per bulan</h3><div id="afTimeline" class="rd-bars"></div></article><article class="insight-panel"><p class="eyebrow">AUDIT COVERAGE</p><h3>Finding per audit</h3><div id="afAudits" class="rd-bars"></div></article></div><div class="csf-form-actions"><button id="aftDashboardManage" class="button button-accent" type="button">Kelola Audit dan Finding</button><button id="aftDashboardManageInline" class="button button-quiet" type="button">Lihat semua audit</button><button class="button button-quiet" type="button" data-aft-tab="smtp">Pengaturan reminder</button></div>
  </div>
  <div id="aftSmtpPanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aftSmtpTab" hidden>
  <p id="aftReminderAccess" class="muted" hidden>Pengaturan SMTP dan reminder hanya dapat dikelola oleh Admin. Hubungi Admin untuk mengatur penerima dan jadwal reminder Finding.</p>
  <section id="aftReminderPanel" class="insight-panel" hidden><h3>Reminder berdasarkan jenis audit dan finding</h3>
    <p id="aftReminderConnection" class="muted" role="status"></p>
    <button id="aftReminderSmtp" class="button button-quiet" type="button">Buka SMTP Admin</button>
    <form id="aftReminderForm" class="risk-register-form smtp-settings"><label>Akun SMTP<select id="aftReminderAccount"></select></label><div class="smtp-card-heading"><span class="smtp-step">1</span><div><h4>Jadwal &amp; penerima</h4><p>Tentukan kapan dan kepada siapa pengingat dikirim.</p></div></div><div class="risk-register-grid">
      <label><input id="aftReminderEnabled" type="checkbox"> Aktifkan reminder finding otomatis</label>
      <label>Ingatkan mulai H-<input id="aftReminderDays" type="number" min="0" max="365" value="7" required></label>
      <label>Satuan waktu mulai<select id="aftReminderStartUnit"><option value="days">Hari</option><option value="months">Bulan</option></select></label>
      <label><input id="aftReminderRepeatDaily" type="checkbox"> Aktifkan pengulangan sampai hari H</label>
      <label>Ulangi setiap<input id="aftReminderRepeatEvery" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="1" required></label>
      <label>Satuan interval<select id="aftReminderRepeatUnit"><option value="days">Hari</option><option value="months">Bulan</option></select></label>
      <label>Maksimum jumlah pengiriman<input id="aftReminderMaxDeliveries" type="number" min="1" max="366" value="366" required aria-describedby="aftReminderMaxHint"><small id="aftReminderMaxHint" class="muted">Termasuk pengiriman pertama, per finding dan penerima. Contoh: 3 berarti maksimal 3 kali sesuai interval yang dipilih. Tanpa pengulangan, hanya dikirim sekali.</small></label>
    </div><div class="risk-register-text-grid"><label>Email penerima (satu per baris)<textarea id="aftReminderRecipients" rows="4" placeholder="auditor@example.com&#10;pic.it@example.com&#10;manager@example.com" aria-describedby="aftReminderRecipientsHint"></textarea><small id="aftReminderRecipientsHint" class="muted">Contoh: masukkan auditor@example.com pada baris pertama, lalu tekan Enter untuk menambahkan pic.it@example.com pada baris berikutnya. Isi alamat email saja, tanpa nama, tanda koma, titik koma, atau format PIC = email. Ganti alamat contoh dengan email penerima sebenarnya.</small></label></div>
    <p class="muted">Email berisi jenis audit dan finding. Reminder dikirim untuk finding yang belum Closed, memiliki tenggat, dan berada dalam rentang H- yang dipilih sampai hari H (tanggal tenggat). Jika pengulangan aktif, email dikirim sesuai interval hari atau bulan per finding dan penerima hingga jumlah maksimum tercapai atau hari H; jika tidak, hanya sekali. Reminder berhenti setelah hari H atau saat finding Closed. Follow-up dan Evidence tidak digunakan sebagai pemicu. Contoh: mulai H-3 bulan, ulangi setiap 1 bulan, maksimum 4 pengiriman untuk H-3, H-2, H-1 bulan dan hari H. Bulan mengikuti kalender; tanggal yang tidak tersedia memakai hari terakhir bulan tersebut. Jadwal yang terlewat dikirim sekali saat pemeriksaan berikutnya, selama belum melewati hari H. Koneksi email menggunakan akun SMTP yang dipilih.</p>
    <section class="smtp-card" aria-labelledby="aftReminderContentTitle">
      <div class="smtp-card-heading"><span class="smtp-step">2</span><div><h4 id="aftReminderContentTitle">Konten email reminder</h4><p>Edit subjek dan isi email yang akan diterima penerima reminder. Pesan dikirim sebagai teks biasa.</p></div></div>
      <div class="smtp-fields">
        <div class="smtp-wide"><button id="aftReminderUseTemplate" class="button button-quiet" type="button">Gunakan template standar</button><p>Template berisi ringkasan temuan, PIC, tenggat, dan langkah tindak lanjut. Tombol ini mengganti subjek dan isi pada formulir. Anda dapat mengeditnya sebelum menekan Simpan reminder.</p></div>
        <label class="smtp-wide">Subjek email<input id="aftReminderSubject" required maxlength="200" aria-describedby="aftReminderVariables"></label>
        <label class="smtp-wide">Isi email<textarea id="aftReminderBody" required maxlength="10000" rows="10" aria-describedby="aftReminderVariables"></textarea></label>
        <div class="smtp-wide" id="aftReminderVariables"><p>Teks di dalam {{...}} akan diganti otomatis dengan data finding saat email dikirim. Biarkan nama variabel tetap seperti contoh; kalimat lainnya bebas diedit.</p>
          <div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table"><thead><tr><th>Variabel</th><th>Diisi otomatis dengan</th><th>Contoh</th></tr></thead><tbody>
            <tr><td><code>{{auditTitle}}</code></td><td data-translate-ui>Jenis / judul audit</td><td data-translate-ui>Audit Keamanan Informasi</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>{{finding}}</code></td><td data-translate-ui>Judul temuan</td><td data-translate-ui>Review akses belum selesai</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>{{owner}}</code></td><td data-translate-ui>PIC finding</td><td data-translate-ui>PIC Audit</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>{{status}}</code></td><td data-translate-ui>Status finding</td><td data-translate-ui>Open</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>{{dueDate}}</code></td><td data-translate-ui>Tanggal tenggat (tahun-bulan-tanggal)</td><td>2026-12-31</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>{{description}}</code></td><td data-translate-ui>Deskripsi / rekomendasi finding</td><td data-translate-ui>Lakukan review dan lampirkan evidence.</td></tr>
          </tbody></table></div><p>Contoh: "Mohon {{owner}} menyelesaikan temuan sebelum {{dueDate}}." menjadi "Mohon PIC Audit menyelesaikan temuan sebelum 2026-12-31." PIC yang disebut dalam isi tidak mengubah daftar email penerima.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="smtp-wide"><h4>Pratinjau dengan data contoh</h4><strong id="aftReminderPreviewSubject"></strong><pre id="aftReminderPreviewBody" style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:inherit;line-height:1.7;background:#f3f8f5;padding:16px;border-radius:8px"></pre></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="csf-form-actions"><button id="aftReminderSave" class="button button-accent" type="submit">Simpan reminder</button><button id="aftReminderReload" class="button button-quiet" type="button">Muat ulang pengaturan</button></div></form>
    <div class="toolbar"><label>Email tujuan percobaan<input id="aftReminderTestTo" type="email" placeholder="nama.anda@example.com" aria-describedby="aftReminderTestHint"><small id="aftReminderTestHint" class="muted">Simpan perubahan terlebih dahulu. Email percobaan menggunakan konten tersimpan dengan data contoh pada pratinjau. Isi satu alamat email Anda untuk menerima email contoh melalui SMTP Admin. Tombol ini langsung mengirim email percobaan; penerima reminder otomatis tidak berubah.</small></label><button id="aftReminderTest" class="button button-quiet" type="button">Kirim email percobaan</button></div>
    <p id="aftReminderStatus" class="save-state" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>
  </div>
  <div id="aftManagePanel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="aftManageTab" hidden>
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h3>Kelola Audit</h3><p class="muted">Pilih Audit, lalu kelola Finding, Follow-up, dan Evidence.</p></div><button id="aftNew" class="button button-accent" type="button">Tambah Audit</button></div>
  <article class="insight-panel gd-list-context"><p id="afDrillStatus" class="muted" role="status"></p><div class="csf-actions"><button id="afBackDashboard" type="button" class="button button-quiet">Kembali ke dashboard</button><button id="afClearDrill" type="button" class="button button-quiet">Hapus drill-down</button><button id="afListReset" type="button" class="button button-quiet">Reset semua filter</button></div></article>
  <nav id="aftBreadcrumb" class="risk-management-tabs" aria-label="Hierarki audit"></nav>
  <p id="aftContext" class="muted"></p>
  <div class="toolbar"><label class="search-box"><span>/</span><input id="aftSearch" type="search" placeholder="Cari data pada tingkat ini" aria-label="Cari audit finding"></label><select id="aftFilter" aria-label="Filter status"><option value="">Semua status</option><option>Open</option><option>In progress</option><option>Closed</option></select><button id="aftRefresh" class="button button-quiet" type="button">Muat ulang</button></div>
  
  <div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table"><thead><tr><th>Judul / Referensi</th><th>PIC</th><th>Status</th><th id="aftDateColumn">Tenggat</th><th>Detail</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody id="aftBody"></tbody></table></div>
  </div>
  <dialog id="aftModal" class="certification-modal"><form id="aftForm" class="risk-register-form"><div class="section-heading compact"><h3 id="aftFormTitle">Tambah Audit</h3></div><div class="risk-register-grid">
    <label>Judul<input name="title" required maxlength="200"></label><label>Referensi<input name="reference" maxlength="100"></label><label>PIC<input name="owner" maxlength="160"></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option>Open</option><option>In progress</option><option>Closed</option></select></label><label><span id="aftDateLabel">Tenggat</span><input name="dueDate" type="date"></label><label id="aftSeverityLabel">Severity<select name="severity"><option>Low</option><option selected>Medium</option><option>High</option><option>Critical</option></select></label>
  </div><div class="risk-register-text-grid"><label>Deskripsi / rekomendasi / hasil tindak lanjut<textarea name="description" rows="4" maxlength="10000"></textarea></label><label id="aftFileLabel">Tambah file evidence (maksimum 10 file, 10 MB per file)<input name="file" type="file" multiple><small class="muted">File baru ditambahkan ke lampiran yang sudah ada. Pilih beberapa file sekaligus.</small></label></div><section id="aftLibraryPanel" class="insight-panel" hidden><h4>Pilih file yang pernah diunggah</h4><p class="muted">File Policy Register dan Uploaded Files. Admin dapat memilih semua file; pengguna lain hanya file unggahannya sendiri. File dipakai sebagai lampiran tanpa menyalin atau mengubah pemiliknya.</p><label>Cari file<input id="aftLibrarySearch" type="search" placeholder="Nama file, isi policy atau Vault terkait..."></label><p id="aftLibraryStatus" role="status"></p><div id="aftLibraryList" style="max-height:240px;overflow:auto"></div><button id="aftLibraryReload" class="button button-quiet" type="button">Muat ulang daftar file</button></section><div id="aftExistingFile" class="insight-panel" hidden><p>File yang sudah diunggah</p><div id="aftExistingFileList"></div><p class="muted">Hapus dari evidence berlaku setelah Simpan. File tetap tersedia di Uploaded Files. Evidence harus memiliki minimal satu file.</p></div><p id="aftFormStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="csf-form-actions"><button id="aftSave" class="button button-accent" type="submit">Simpan</button><button id="aftCancel" class="button button-quiet" type="button">Tutup</button></div></form></dialog>
</section>
</template>
